Subject: [PATCH 310/333] [ae-patch] Make the sidebar count pills readable on
 the selected row and let them grow with the font

Review of patch 0309: the red and grey tints fell under AA on the selected Admin Center row's pink wash (grey 3.3:1, red 3.5:1 in light, 3.9:1 in dark). Red is now solid with white text (the dark theme's background colour in dark) and the grey count's text is foreground at 80%; every pill measures 5.2:1 or more. The 19 px height is now a minimum so a large Appearance size grows the pill, and the comment names the slots pill's real trigger (at the limit).
